# Stray JSONL session-writer output at the repo root only (root-anchored, not
# a blanket *.jsonl — data/sessions/*.jsonl etc. are handled by the rule
# above and any future legitimate nested .jsonl content stays trackable).
# Root-level JSONL here is always a test/tooling bug: phantom/runtime.py and
# scripts/record-csi-udp.py both default their output_dir under data/, never
# the repo root — see tests/test_phantom_cross_node_correlation.py's
# output_dir="" fix (PhantomScan_FollowUp_Session_Report.md, Item D).
/*.jsonl

